###How to configure to connect:

Do the following steps, to be sure that all possibilities are covered;

1. From the Tool repository, run the patcher on your game files Wow.exe and Wow-64.exe.
2. Launch the game (x86 -> WoW.exe / x64 -> WoW-64.exe).
3. Exit the game.
4. Navigate to the folder "WTF" in your game folder.
5. Open the file "Config.wtf" with any text editor (windows notepad, as example)
   and amend the following line (or add it at the end if it doesn't exist).
   SET realmlist "127.0.0.1" - or the IP Address of your server.
6. Save the file.

7. Login at game using an account.

   Note: Usernames must be in the form of an email address:

     eg. MyUser@AwesomeServer.com
